join horus (Right) leftmost
join osiris (Left) rightmost
horus: Hey Osiris, whatever happened to Watsu?
osiris: Who?
horus: You know, Watsu. Our beta tester before we launched Lucifer.
osiris: Oh. Honestly? No clue. He might still be drifting near the Big Bang.
join aphrodite (Pro Angry LG) center
aphrodite: This institutional cruelty has to stop!
leave osiris
update aphrodite (Left Angry) rightmost [animation="Heartbeat" fade="Fade Cross" fade_length="0.2"]
horus: Aphrodite? What are you yelling about?
aphrodite: The horrific treatment of Watsu!
aphrodite: He is a dear personal friend of mine and a hero to the goddesses.
aphrodite: Suprema is literally preparing to award him the Medal of Celestial Honor!
horus: Medal of Honor?!
horus: Aphrodite, Watsu is a certified psychopath and a serial murderer.
horus (Right Angry): The council has twenty-four active warrants out for him!
aphrodite (Left): He is eccentric, misunderstood, and under our sanctuary protection.
leave horus [animation="Bounce Out"]
join osiris (Right Angry) leftmost [animation="Bounce In"]
osiris: Well, if he ever lands, we're flinging him straight to the underworld.
leave osiris [animation="Bounce Out"]
join horus (Pro) leftmost [animation="Bounce In"]
horus (Right): And that's if he survives re-entry at light speed.
aphrodite: You will touch him over Suprema's dead body!
leave horus [animation="Bounce Out"]
join osiris (Pro) leftmost [animation="Bounce In"]
osiris (Right): Don't tempt me with a good time.
osiris (Right Angry): Horus, do we still have that vial of poison in the pantry?
leave osiris [animation="Bounce Out"]
join horus (Pro) leftmost [animation="Bounce In"]
horus (Pro Happy): Vintage belladonna extract. Kept cold just for her.
aphrodite: I am reporting this directly to the High Council!
leave horus [animation="Bounce Out"]
leave aphrodite [animation="Bounce In"]
